+The governing body preserves the exact Indian mathematical/metaphysical milieu, Abhinavagupta’s Kashmiri co-internal/transcendental layers, Kaplan’s several zero histories, Gebser’s co-present structures and reception of reports as psychic facts. The intended approximately-century interval remains a named source-collation task, not a fabricated first-zero date. The two logics’ worked break/retention/recognition operation is explicit and is distinguished from diachronic/synchronic reading. Power, Antichrist and the concrete everyday consequences of a tool-world remain constitutive obligations.
+
+A/C gains whole-level grounding around, not within, its frozen ethic and ratified primitive matrix. A26 and C41 distinguish the means from Life/Mind as whole and connect their existing operations to the full recognition-matheme. C10 retains source-specific validity conditions while making the native pramāṇa appointment explicit. A34/C60 and A34′ qualify their inherited middle-term shorthand without weakening the ontology. A26′ preserves the old Arc IV permission as a historical case and develops the currently authorised T25 operation without treating an authored receipt as Frank’s acceptance.
+
+### Validation actually performed
+
+- Local `git diff --check`: passed for the batch before admission.
+- Protected-file comparison: all 472 baseline SHA-256 values match; no protected source note, raw authorial/theorem file or sovereign manuscript changed. The private frozen ethic body was not available locally; its exact reference and recorded six-movement ruling remain untouched, and no claim of reading that private body is made.
+- Native `status --json` and exact-path `effects … --depth 4 --json`: executed successfully. The starting tool census was 211 canonical nodes, 163 declared-register nodes and 48 undeclared movement nodes. This is not the admitted publication census or the 137-record shared field.
+- Native `doctor --json` after the first substantive batch: 48 missing-register entries (the inherited movement population), two unresolved links (`Dreamcode` in the Descartes house; `Antykathera Essay Work` in the protected theorem alias). No generic declaration of a clean workspace is made.
+- Real GitHub Actions run `34526618182`, source `3ec712b`: 111 unittest cases ran in 370.825 seconds, with 109 passing, one skipped and one failing. The failure is stale generated `submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/maps/navigation/reader-audit.json`, before the substantive canonical batch. The separate effects invocation returned 2 because bare C41 did not resolve. Full logs are retained in Actions artifact `10172057554`. The corrected exact-path effects invocation succeeds locally. R5 must rebuild and re-run; this is not a passing final validation report.
+
+### Return and continuing work
+
+R1 continues with the native root/support recovery and exact source-led Indian/Gebser field; it is not closed by this first batch. R2 receives the settled product subjects, full pairs, one-home identity rule and old-operation destinations. R3 receives the whole-field operation obligations, the preserved theorem and A/C ruling, and the native traversal limitations. R4 receives the product-led M37–M42 plan, early consciousness thread, full station-depth obligation and exact displacement table. Neither a planned successor nor an index is counted as a completed read or canonical product body.
